    "**Views scale almost 1:1 with followers.** 1% more followers means about 0.96% "
    "more views; a 50,000-follower creator can expect roughly 108,700 views.",
    "**Content scores add very little.** Adding engagement, retention, hook and quality "
    "only lifts R² from 0.818 to 0.824 (RMSE 1.230 → 1.212).",
